{"step_index":2162,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-16T07:45:51Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-16T13:15:51+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-10-16T13:15:52+05:30\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/k4ran/.gemini/antigravity/brain/e2c1cf9f-2dff-4bf4-a974-ef410441acfa/walkthrough.md`\nTotal Lines: 141\nTotal Bytes: 4466\nShowing lines 1 to 141\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: # SmartAGENT v0.2.0 — Agentic Build Walkthrough\n2: \n3: ## What Changed\n4: \n5: Transformed SmartAGENT from a **static regex scanner with optional AI verification** into a **fully autonomous agentic security AI** with a ReAct reasoning loop.\n6: \n7: ### Before (v0.1.0)\n8: ```\n9: smartagent scan . → regex patterns → findings list → (optional) AI verify each\n10: ```\n11: \n12: ### After (v0.2.0)\n13: ```\n14: smartagent chat → interactive agent that thinks, plans, uses tools, and acts autonomously\n15: smartagent agent \"scan for SQL injection\" → one-shot autonomous task\n16: smartagent scan . → still works (unchanged)\n17: ```\n18: \n19: ---\n20: \n21: ## New Files (5)\n22: \n23: ### 1. `smartagent/agent/__init__.py`\n24: Package init exposing `SmartAgent` class.\n25: \n26: ### 2. `smartagent/agent/prompts.py`\n27: ReAct system prompt that teaches the model to:\n28: - Think step-by-step before acting\n29: - Use tools with `Action: tool_name` / `Action Input: args` format\n30: - Return `Final Answer:` when reasoning is complete\n31: - Lists all 8 available tools with descriptions\n32: \n33: ### 3. `smartagent/agent/memory.py`\n34: Sliding-window conversation memory:\n35: - Preserves system prompt (always first message)\n36: - Keeps last 20 messages (configurable)\n37: - Tracks which files have been scanned\n38: - Accumulates findings across tool calls\n39: \n40: ### 4. `smartagent/agent/tools.py`\n41: 8 security-focused tools:\n42: \n43: | Tool | Description |\n44: |---|---|\n45: | `list_files` | Lists code files in a directory, respects ignore patterns \n<truncated 1542 bytes>\nmport\n74: \n75: ### `smartagent/config.py`\n76: Added 4 agent config fields:\n77: - `max_agent_iterations: int = 15`\n78: - `agent_temperature: float = 0.3`\n79: - `memory_window: int = 20`\n80: - `allowed_commands: list` (sandboxed shell allowlist)\n81: - Fixed default model ID to `k4ran909/Fluxnat-Coder-3B`\n82: \n83: ### `smartagent/cli.py`\n84: Added 2 new CLI commands:\n85: - **`smartagent chat`** — Interactive REPL with Rich formatting. Supports `exit`, `quit`, `reset`.\n86: - **`smartagent agent \"task\"`** — One-shot autonomous task execution\n87: - Updated version display to `0.2.0 (Agentic)`\n88: - Shows \"Agent Mode: Available\" in system info\n89: \n90: ### `pyproject.toml`\n91: - Version bumped to `0.2.0`\n92: - Updated description\n93: \n94: ---\n95: \n96: ## Verification Results\n97: \n98: All tests pass:\n99: ```\n100: PASS: Final Answer parsing\n101: PASS: Action parsing\n102: PASS: Memory sliding window\n103: PASS: search_code tool\n104: PASS: Command sandboxing blocks dangerous commands\n105: PASS: git status allowed\n106: \n107: ALL TESTS PASSED\n108: ```\n109: \n110: CLI shows all 5 commands:\n111: ```\n112: Commands:\n113:   scan    Perform an automated vulnerability audit\n114:   train   Launch training for Fluxnat Coder 3B\n115:   info    Display system status\n116:   chat    Launch interactive agentic chat        ← NEW\n117:   agent   Run a one-shot agentic task            ← NEW\n118: ```\n119: \n120: ---\n121: \n122: ## How to Use\n123: \n124: ### Interactive Chat\n125: ```bash\n126: python -m smartagent.cli chat\n127: ```\n128: \n129: ### One-Shot Agent\n130: ```bash\n131: python -m smartagent.cli agent \"scan this project for SQL injection\"\n132: ```\n133: \n134: ### Classic Static Scan (unchanged)\n135: ```bash\n136: python -m smartagent.cli scan .\n137: ```\n138: \n139: > [!NOTE]\n140: > The agent requires the Fluxnat Coder 3B model (loaded in 4-bit on your GTX 1650). First run will download from `k4ran909/Fluxnat-Coder-3B` on HuggingFace (~1.8GB quantized).\n141: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
{"step_index":2163,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-16T07:45:51Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-16T13:15:51+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-10-16T13:15:52+05:30\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/k4ran/.gemini/antigravity/brain/e2c1cf9f-2dff-4bf4-a974-ef410441acfa/implementation_plan.md`\nTotal Lines: 174\nTotal Bytes: 7923\nShowing lines 1 to 174\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: # Make SmartAGENT Fully Agentic\n2: \n3: Transform SmartAGENT from a **static scanner with AI verification** into a **fully autonomous agentic security AI** that can think, plan, use tools, and act on its own.\n4: \n5: ## What Changes\n6: \n7: **Before:** You run `smartagent scan .` → static regex patterns find issues → optionally asks the LLM to verify each one.\n8: \n9: **After:** You chat with SmartAGENT like a real security engineer:\n10: ```\n11: You: scan this project for vulnerabilities\n12: Agent: [Thought] I'll start by listing all files in the project...\n13:        [Action] list_files → found 47 files\n14:        [Thought] Let me read the main app.py first...\n15:        [Action] read_file app.py → found SQL query on line 34\n16:        [Thought] This uses f-string interpolation in a SQL query — CWE-89...\n17:        [Action] scan_code → CRITICAL: SQL Injection\n18:        [Thought] Let me check if there's input sanitization upstream...\n19:        [Action] read_file utils.py → no sanitization found\n20:        [Answer] Found 3 vulnerabilities. Here's the full report...\n21: ```\n22: \n23: ---\n24: \n25: ## Architecture\n26: \n27: ```\n28: ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n29: │              Interactive CLI (Rich)           │\n30: │         smartagent chat / smartagent scan     │\n31: └──────────────────┬─────────────────────\n<truncated 5173 bytes>\n0.0` for interactive chat input with history\n134: - Add `readchar>=4.0.0` for key handling\n135: - No other new dependencies — everything else uses existing packages (rich, transformers, torch)\n136: \n137: ---\n138: \n139: ## File Summary\n140: \n141: | File | Action | Purpose |\n142: |---|---|---|\n143: | `smartagent/agent/__init__.py` | **NEW** | Pack